# One step leaves a file for the next, which reads it and uses what it read: the place is the object between them.

route stages.run
step run/fetch
step run/process

line entry > run call
line run/fetch > File(data/stage.txt) own
line File(data/stage.txt) > run/process own
line run/process > run back
line run > Screen own

side entry left
side File(data/stage.txt) between
side Screen right
